  m_text: 'Welcome to the development and testing world for <b>VRpg</b>.

    VRpg
    is a system for running <color=yellow>RPGs/LARPs</color> inside VRchat. Features
    include:


    - Dice rollers and systems

    - Logs

    - GM tools

    -
    Character sheet importing

    - and more!


    Get more info at our discord
    at: <color=#ff9797>https://discord.gg/gibgames</color>


    See VRpg in action
    and one of the worlds in the Portals to the left!


    Access the VRpg repo
    at <color=#00FFFF>VRCPrefabs</color>!'
